Live project search in the ledger filter (1.10.0)

The filter listed every project in a dropdown. On an agency with years of
history that is hundreds of rows, and scanning it is slower than typing
the name. It is the same live-search combobox the people forms use, and
the selected id still travels as a hidden input so the URL-driven filter
keeps working — shareable links and the back button included.

